    witcher:skin_color "Dark<ref group=\"N\">Unlike  videogame and  with their exclusively green-skinned dryads, dryads of  have much more human complexion, with only tints of various \"forest colors\" instead. While Woédgláeddyv's complexion is only vaguely described as \"dark\" in the campaign book, Biały Wilk 1 specifically mentions \"chestnut\" color as one of such tints possible.</ref>" ;
